 erving their country\, H.R.2317\, to provide for transfer of ownership of 
 certain Federal lands in northern Nevada\, to authorize the disposal of ce
 rtain Federal lands in northern Nevada for economic development\, to promo
 te conservation in northern Nevada\, and the nominations of Dennis Kirk\, 
